    <p>Today we are going to build some basic neural nets using <url href="https://pytorch.org/">pytorch</url>.</p>
    <p>This lecture makes use of many helpful available tutorials, including those listed below:</p>
    <p><ul>
      <li>
        <p><url href="https://pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/quickstart_tutorial.html">https://pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/quickstart_tutorial.html</url></p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p><url href="https://pythonprogramming.net/data-deep-learning-neural-network-pytorch/?completed=/introduction-deep-learning-neural-network-pytorch/">https://pythonprogramming.net/data-deep-learning-neural-network-pytorch/?completed=/introduction-deep-learning-neural-network-pytorch/</url></p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p><url href="https://towardsdatascience.com/building-neural-network-using-pytorch-84f6e75f9a">https://towardsdatascience.com/building-neural-network-using-pytorch-84f6e75f9a</url></p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p><url href="https://github.com/amitrajitbose/handwritten-digit-recognition/">https://github.com/amitrajitbose/handwritten-digit-recognition/</url></p>
      </li>
    </ul></p>
